          {
            "title": "Code: Counter variable",
            "id": 78990,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Użyj zmiennej <code>counter</code>, aby ustawić warunek na wartość mniejszą niż <code>11</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Updating payroll&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>while</code>, następnie <code>counter</code>, a potem <code>&lt;</code>, <code>11</code>, <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wyświetl <code>Updating payroll</code> dokładnie osiem razy, a potem zatrzymaj pętlę. Umieść <code>counter</code> po lewej stronie porównania.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Updating payroll&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating payroll\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>while</code>, następnie <code>counter</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>11</code> i na końcu <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
