            "id": 78415,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(counter)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>W obecnej postaci ten kod wyświetla <code>2</code>. Która pojedyncza zmiana sprawiłaby, że wyświetli zamiast tego <code>4</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(counter)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Zmień warunek na <code>counter &lt; 4</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Zmień <code>counter += 1</code> na <code>counter += 4</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Zmień <code>counter = 1</code> na <code>counter = 0</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Zmień warunek na <code>counter &lt; 4</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
