            "id": 78417,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Liczby <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> i <code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Liczby <code>1</code>, <code>2</code> i <code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Liczby <code>0</code>, <code>1</code>, <code>2</code> i <code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Liczby <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> i <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>W obecnej postaci ta pętla wyświetla <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> i <code>2</code>, co widać w konsoli. Co zrobiłaby, gdyby usunąć wiersz <code>counter += 1</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(counter)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Wyświetlałaby <code>0</code> w kółko, bez zatrzymania.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Wyświetliłaby <code>0</code> jeden raz i zatrzymała się.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nadal wyświetliłaby <code>0</code>, <code>1</code> i <code>2</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wyświetlałaby <code>0</code> w kółko, bez zatrzymania.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
