          {
            "title": "Example: Incrementing",
            "id": 79150,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>W bloku kodu pętli <code>for</code> dodaj <code>~</code> do zmiennej <code>line</code>, używając operatora <code>+=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;*&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"line = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  line += \" /><text value=\"&quot;~&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(line)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"51\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"*\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~~\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~~~\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~~~~\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>+=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: i counter",
            "id": 79145,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Która zmienna jest zmienną licznikową pętli <code>for</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"line = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  line += i\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(line)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>line</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>in</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jakie wartości mają <code>i</code> i <code>line</code> pod koniec trzeciego powtórzenia?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"line = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  line += i\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(line)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code> ma wartość <code>2</code>, a <code>line</code> ma wartość <code>3</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code> ma wartość <code>3</code>, a <code>line</code> ma wartość <code>3</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code> ma wartość <code>2</code>, a <code>line</code> ma wartość <code>2</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>i</code> ma wartość <code>2</code>, a <code>line</code> ma wartość <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
